"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:6.13\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">6.13</span> 標題：涼鞋、鞋（sandal, shoe）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： נַעַל, נעל</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： na‘al)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01014023\" data-end-ref=\"01014023\">GEN 14:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02003005\" data-end-ref=\"02003005\">EXO 3:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02012011\" data-end-ref=\"02012011\">EXO 12:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05025009\" data-end-ref=\"05025009\">DEU 25:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05025010\" data-end-ref=\"05025010\">DEU 25:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05029004\" data-end-ref=\"05029004\">DEU 29:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06005015\" data-end-ref=\"06005015\">JOS 5:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06009005\" data-end-ref=\"06009005\">JOS 9:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06009013\" data-end-ref=\"06009013\">JOS 9:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"08004007\" data-end-ref=\"08004007\">RUT 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"08004008\" data-end-ref=\"08004008\">RUT 4:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11002005\" data-end-ref=\"11002005\">1KI 2:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14028015\" data-end-ref=\"14028015\">2CH 28:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19060010\" data-end-ref=\"19060010\">PSA 60:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19108010\" data-end-ref=\"19108010\">PSA 108:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"22007002\" data-end-ref=\"22007002\">SNG 7:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23005027\" data-end-ref=\"23005027\">ISA 5:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23011015\" data-end-ref=\"23011015\">ISA 11:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23020002\" data-end-ref=\"23020002\">ISA 20:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26016010\" data-end-ref=\"26016010\">EZK 16:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26024017\" data-end-ref=\"26024017\">EZK 24:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26024023\" data-end-ref=\"26024023\">EZK 24:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"30002006\" data-end-ref=\"30002006\">AMO 2:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"30008006\" data-end-ref=\"30008006\">AMO 8:6</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： σανδάλιον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： sandalion)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41006009\" data-end-ref=\"41006009\">MRK 6:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44012008\" data-end-ref=\"44012008\">ACT 12:8</data>, JDT 10:4, JDT 16:9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： ὑπόδημα, ὑποδέομαι</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： hupodēma, hupodeomai（動詞）)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40003011\" data-end-ref=\"40003011\">MAT 3:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40010010\" data-end-ref=\"40010010\">MAT 10:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41001007\" data-end-ref=\"41001007\">MRK 1:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41006009\" data-end-ref=\"41006009\">MRK 6:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42003016\" data-end-ref=\"42003016\">LUK 3:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42010004\" data-end-ref=\"42010004\">LUK 10:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42015022\" data-end-ref=\"42015022\">LUK 15:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42022035\" data-end-ref=\"42022035\">LUK 22:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43001027\" data-end-ref=\"43001027\">JHN 1:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44012008\" data-end-ref=\"44012008\">ACT 12:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44007033\" data-end-ref=\"44007033\">ACT 7:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013025\" data-end-ref=\"44013025\">ACT 13:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49006015\" data-end-ref=\"49006015\">EPH 6:15</data>, SIR 46:19</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述和用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0507_sandals.jpg\" alt=\"馬撒大（Masada）北部宮殿的皮涼鞋，公元73年\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">馬撒大（Masada）北部宮殿的皮涼鞋，公元73年 (Gary Todd, Israel Museum, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons)</figcaption></figure>涼鞋是一種步行鞋，鞋底用皮革（也可能是木頭）製成，在腳踝處用皮帶子固定。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻譯</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>有時，「涼鞋」一詞是指特別貧窮的人所穿的鞋，有時僅指休閒或運動時穿的鞋。如果是這種情況，翻譯者最好使用鞋的統稱，其中包含了涼鞋。</p>\n<p>\n            <figure class=\"thlex-image\"><img class=\"thlex-img\" src=\"images/WEB-0507_sandals.jpg\" alt=\"馬撒大（Masada）北部宮殿的皮涼鞋，公元73年\"><figcaption class=\"thlex-caption\">馬撒大（Masada）北部宮殿的皮涼鞋，公元73年 (Gary Todd, Israel Museum, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons)</figcaption></figure>在聖經時期，涼鞋不像大多數現代的涼鞋那樣是搭扣的，而是用帶子繞著腳踝繫牢。在提到穿鞋或脫鞋的經文中，翻譯者應該選擇一個指繫鞋帶或解鞋帶的詞，而不要用表示搭扣的詞。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
